# deploy/ is copied onto Linux machines (an appliance, a server) and read by
# systemd and Caddy there. Checked out with CRLF (this repo is worked on from
# Windows with core.autocrlf on), those files carry a carriage return into
# every value. Pinned to LF here only; the rest of the repo keeps whatever
# each contributor's Git does.
deploy/** text eol=lf
